  "details": "Pictures taken with horizontally pinned lens should saved as horizontal photos. Now, image directions are set by rotation of the hand-held camera screen, so if you want to shot a horizontal photo with horizontally set lens and if you held camera as portrait angle, the picture save as portrait. I think this behavior would be confusing. It can be helpful if photo directions are considered by direction of the lens instead of the screen.",
